      "source": "A common key class for a method against a specific target class,\nincluding <a href=\"#toString()\"><code>toString()</code></a> representation and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Comparable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Comparable</code></a>\nsupport (as suggested for custom <code>HashMap</code> keys as of Java 8).",
